<<else>><<set $rescued += 1>>

A <<generate3>><<person3>><<person>> looks over and witnesses the struggle. <<He>> pulls out <<his>> phone and starts dialling. The <<person1>><<person>> grabs the <<person2>><<persons>> arm and points, then together they run down a nearby alleyway.<br><br>

<<tearful>> you struggle to your feet.<br><br>

<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>

<<set $logprep to $logprep + " and was saved from them by a passing person.">>
<<log $logprep 3>>
<<logopinion "That was awful">>
<<destinationeventend>>

<</if>>
